{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ今日からNOGIBINGO！7が\n放送開始されますね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おまたせしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいことにまた番組が\n帰ってきたことが本当に嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また新しい乃木坂をみてもらえるように\nがんばります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけどね、ちょっと\n個人的に見逃して欲しいところもあって。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん流れるであろう\n楽屋裏は片目くらいでみてほしいな。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛と楽屋で過ごすと\n毎回はじめちゃうんだよね。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいからやめられないけど！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/11/5801567/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FLASHスペシャルさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中です～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/11/5801567/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/11/5801567/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夕方から久しぶりに\n妹と2人でお買い物に行きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯ケースとボトムスを買ってあげたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉ちゃんらしい！\nお姉ちゃんらしいことしちゃった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面倒見いいほうだよ、きっと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃から妹のお世話してあげてたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹にはおせっかいだったと思うけど！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂にはいる直前くらいまでは\n妹とお洋服がお揃いなのとか色違いなのとか\n嫌だったけど、\n高校3年生になってお姉ちゃんより\n友達を優先するようになってから\n寂しくて妹離れできてない(｡ρω-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからなんでも買っちゃうよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/11/5801567/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/11/5801567/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹を動物で隠したので\n私も動物になった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/11/5801567/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ2.3日寒い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋がまだきてないよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏から冬になった気分！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋も味わいたいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少しあったかいくらいの\n秋がいいよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外がカラッとして少し寒いと\n好きじゃないマラソン大会を思い出します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きじゃないのに思い出します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長距離は苦手です。\nゴールが遠いいから(｡ρω-｡)\n見えないくらい先にあるゴールに向かっては頑張れないタイプでした(｡ρω-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、小学校6年生のマラソン大会は\n最後だからということもあって\n学年で12位だったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"35人くらいの5クラス編成だったんだけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子だけだけどね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それまでは、頑張れなかったから\n46位とかだったの！\nやたら毎年46位くらいだった印象(｡ρω-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4と6と1と3と2には割と縁があるかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、ほぼだね、これじゃあ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/11/5801567/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀北コンビ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FLASHスペシャルだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/11/5801567/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈といると普段\n未央奈の方がよしかかってくるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりバッッッときて\nいきなりバッッッとどっかいく！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/11/5801567/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！またあした！"}],"source":"archive"}